00:27:02.160 --> 00:27:03.270
the [INAUDIBLE]?

00:27:06.498 --> 00:27:07.790
It's not clear that-- because--

00:27:07.790 --> 00:27:07.940
BRENDAN JUBA: I
don't [INAUDIBLE]----

00:27:07.940 --> 00:27:09.640
AUDIENCE: --you
don't want to-- you

00:27:09.640 --> 00:27:11.940
