00:27:55.170 --> 00:27:55.920
BRENDAN JUBA: Mhm.

00:27:55.920 --> 00:27:59.690
MODERATOR: But if it's
something with symmetries,

00:27:59.690 --> 00:28:01.880
like in the first-order
